Sum of premiums for options of this underlying.

When `callput` is 
- `""` (default) then all options are included;
- `"C"` then only call-options are included;
- `"P"` then only put-options are included.
 Parameter `daysToExpUpTo` filters options by their expiration, keeping only options with expiration date not later than given number of days from today.
